WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
(mechanical noise) The machine stretches to infinity.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Proog guides Emo through impossible corridors.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
"To the left!" shouts Proog. "Trust me!"

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Emo starts to doubt what he sees.
